=== Day3 ===
Hi love! How are you?
I tried calling you, but I know right now you're probably not home.
Anyway, I'm leaving you this message.
I miss you!
It's getting cold here. The sun is setting right now, so it should be midday at home.
Or was it midnight?
I can't never remember if it was 12 hours avanti o indietro.

The lady is glad I'm here but i'm feeling homesick whenever i have to cook.
Uff, I promised myself these phonecalls had to be happier, but whenever I think of you, i can't help but becoming nostalgic.
Shouldn't be long luckily!
I think any day now we're gonna reach a breakpoint!
And I may be able to come back sooner.
But I wouldn't take my word for it.
Sometime I think i got in the wrong area of work.
Things are so hard sometime I'm not sure I can grasp all the concepts we're studying!
And I'm supposed to make the public presentation?
No way.

I have to go, now.
Remember to keep our bedroom clean!
I know you always leave the clothes all around the floor!
And don't forget to eat. I know cooking bores you if it's not for me, but pretend I will have a taste and make something delicous for me. Okay?
How is it going at work? Are they treating my boy well?

Oh, and clean the bathroom!
I forgot to do it before leaving and I have a feeling you didn't clean it since I left.
It's gotta be a mess...

Love you! Bye




-> END
